Z||000001||Terrybogin||03-24-2000||10:26 PM||||My program (MGI PhotoSuite) has a check mark box that says "stretch to new size" that has to be checked to make the whole pic change to the new size. You can also reduce colors to 256 to shrink the file size of a pic.||||reg||1
