Z||000004||Fformula88||03-26-2000||06:21 PM||||If you right click on the picture, and hit copy from the menu, and then paste them somewhere else can you get them out of the border?  Also, click on it the same way and try saving the pic as another file.  Maybe you can get the pic out of the border that way.||||reg||1
